cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CHF GDMT Titration Pipeline"
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ramaseshu
abstract: >
  A synthetic-data + ML + rule-engine pipeline that recommends weekly
  guideline-directed medical therapy (GDMT) titration decisions for patients
  with congestive heart failure. Combines a LightGBM classifier for adverse
  effect detection with a deterministic titration engine over five drug
  classes (RAAS / β-blocker / MRA / SGLT2i / loop diuretic) and a Streamlit
  UI for clinician review.
keywords:
  - congestive-heart-failure
  - GDMT
  - titration
  - clinical-decision-support
  - MIMIC-IV
  - LightGBM
  - synthetic-data
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-25"
